# Start a pick's capture and perception before its PickObject goal (while the
# task-pose preparation runs). Fire and forget: the goal uses the result only for
# the same target, when the robot has not moved since the capture; otherwise it
# observes again. container_query, when set, also detects the place's container.
DispatchBinding dispatch_binding
string target_query
string container_query
---
bool accepted
string reason
